{"id":"ed8a8913a232395cd764fb6cafae3123f72a193e","axis":"silent","repo":"apache/tika","sha":"ed8a8913a232395cd764fb6cafae3123f72a193e","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGES.txt","lines":["@@ -385,10 +385,16 @@ Release 4.3.0 - ???"," ","    * The OpenDocument parser writes repeated cells and rows (table:number-columns-repeated,","      table:number-rows-repeated) once per repeat; a cell was written once with that","-     colspan and a row once, so values repeated across columns or rows were lost. Empty","-     cells and rows at the end of a row or table, such as the filler out to a sheet's","-     last column and row, are dropped. Past 10 million characters of repeated content","-     per document the rest are written once, with a tk:exception:warn entry (TIKA-5014).","+     colspan and a row once, so values repeated across columns or rows were lost. As in","+     the Excel parsers, empty rows are dropped and empty cells are written only to pad","+     out to the next value in their row. Past 10 million characters and elements of","+     padding and repeated content per document, the rest are written once and padding","+     is dropped, with a tk:exception:warn entry (TIKA-5014).","+","+   * The OpenDocument parsers (open-document-parser, flat-open-document-parser) take","+     includeMissingRows, as the Excel parsers do: when true, each empty spreadsheet row","+     before a row with content is written as an empty row, up to 100,000 per document.","+     The default is false (TIKA-5014)."," ","    * VLM text recognizers keep superscripts and subscripts: inline <sup>/<sub> in model","      output (x<sup>2</sup>, H<sub>2</sub>O, footnote markers) reach the XHTML as sup/sub"],"additions":10,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/modules/ROOT/pages/formats.adoc","lines":["@@ -85,6 +85,24 @@ ODF is based;"," link:{api}/org/apache/tika/parser/odf/FlatOpenDocumentParser.html[FlatOpenDocumentParser]"," handles the single-file flat XML variants (`.fodt`, `.fods`, `.fodp`)."," ","+Both write spreadsheet tables as the Excel parsers do: empty rows are dropped,","+empty cells are written only to pad out to the next value in their row, and","+the filler at the end of a row or sheet is dropped. Set `includeMissingRows`","+to write each empty row before a row with content, as `includeMissingRows`","+does for Excel; at most 100,000 are written per document. Set `extractMacros`","+to extract Basic macros.","+","+[source,json]","+----","+{","+  \"parsers\": [","+    { \"default-parser\": {} },","+    { \"open-document-parser\": { \"includeMissingRows\": true } },","+    { \"flat-open-document-parser\": { \"includeMissingRows\": true } }","+  ]","+}","+----","+"," == iWork document formats"," "," The Apple iWork formats (Pages, Numbers, Keynote) are supported by"],"additions":18,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tika-parsers/tika-parsers-standard/tika-parsers-standard-integration-tests/src/test/java/org/apache/tika/parser/odf/ODFParserTest.java","lines":["@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@"," "," import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertEquals;"," ","+import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;"," import java.util.List;"," "," import org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeAll;","@@ -25,6 +26,7 @@"," "," import org.apache.tika.TikaLoaderHelper;"," import org.apache.tika.TikaTest;","+import org.apache.tika.io.TikaInputStream;"," import org.apache.tika.metadata.HttpHeaders;"," import org.apache.tika.metadata.Metadata;"," import org.apache.tika.metadata.PagedText;","@@ -211,4 +213,30 @@ public void testMacroFODP() throws Exception {","     private void assertImageContentType(String expected, String actual) {","         assertEquals(expected, actual);","     }","+","+    @Test","+    public void testIncludeMissingRowsConfig() throws Exception {","+        Parser parser = TikaLoaderHelper.getLoader(\"tika-config-ods-missing-rows.json\")","+                .loadAutoDetectParser();","+        String fods = \"<?xml version=\\\"1.0\\\" encoding=\\\"UTF-8\\\"?>